/*
 * Unified explicit and implicit cast validation.
 *
 * CastValidation provides the high-level dispatching logic for all cast
 * operations in the Ymir semantic validator. It is responsible for:
 *
 *   - validating cast expressions(`CastExpr`),
 *   - performing explicit cast validation,
 *   - performing implicit cast validation,
 *   - selecting explicit casts first, then falling back to implicit casts,
 *   - propagating detailed diagnostics when both cast paths fail.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::operator::cast_
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/operator/cast_.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-05-26
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
